&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anchor text&lt;/strong&gt;: Slabakova, R. (2016). &lt;em&gt;Second Language Acquisition&lt;/em&gt;. &lt;strong&gt;Chapter 10: Acquisition of the Syntax–Semantics Interface&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;
